A poor area now about 40% developed with cheap improvements. Section has dirt streets and no sewers. Many houses are shacks while others were built by owners themselves of used materials. Ground is low and flat and portions subject to sub-surface water flooding. Section has rural mail service and bus transportation. The most popular portion is the Garden City and Mattydale districts. The western portion is dormant and the least desirable. Area warrants only a low third class rating. Typical Sales: (
